Project 1 — Employee REST API
---------------------------------------
Controller mapping:

/employees
Method	API	                                Purpose
POST	http://localhost:8080/employees         Create
GET	http://localhost:8080/employees	        Get all
GET	http://localhost:8080/employees/1	Get by ID
PUT	http://localhost:8080/employees/1	Update
DELETE	http://localhost:8080/employees/1	Delete
POST Body
{
    "name": "Subham",
